      "id": 1,
      "text": "Allentown was founded in 1762 by William Allen, a Philadelphia businessman who later became mayor of the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
