      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Allentown%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "History buffs can tour the Lehigh Valley Heritage Museum, Mack Trucks Historical Museum, America on Wheels, and the Museum of Indian Culture.",
